WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.970
A farm has 200 hectares of land.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.150
One year, it grows 600 tonnes of wheat.

3
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.300
Same farm, same land.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.400
Then it brings in irrigation,

5
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.180
and the harvest jumps to 900 tonnes.

6
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.780
Bread, phones, haircuts.

7
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.500
Every one of them is made from
the same few basic ingredients.

8
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.490
So what are the four
ingredients every product needs

9
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.130
before it can be made?

10
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.540
In this mission, you'll sort every input,

11
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.650
from a fishing boat to a field,

12
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.360
into one of four groups.

13
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.520
Then you'll see what each one earns,

14
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:36.590
and how more and better resources
let an economy produce more.

15
00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.430
Your mission: find out the four
ingredients every product needs,

16
00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.030
and how to spot each one.
